        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Dysphagia"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Difficulty swallowing for approximately 6–8 weeks, mainly with solids such as meat and bread; solids are more affected than liquids. Food feels as though it sticks or stops around the mid sternum. It is happening most days now, and the patient needs to sip water to get food down and occasionally stop and wait."
      }
    },
